/-!
# A180383

T(n,k)=number of increasing sequences of n integers x(1),...,x(n) with values in 1..k*n such that x(j) divides x(k) if j divides k.

The 65 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A180383

